      equipment: 'Standard 52-card pack; cards in each suit rank A, K, Q, J, 10 down to 2. Some variants use a 54-card pack with one or two jokers as extra trumps, or a stripped 32-card deck (A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7 per suit).',
